  "custom_logic_notes": "EA uses ADX (Average Directional Index) to determine trend strength and direction. Long entry when +DI > -DI and ADX main line is above a configurable threshold (indicating strong trend). Short entry when -DI > +DI and ADX main line above threshold. The ADX level threshold acts as a trend strength filter to avoid trading in ranging markets. Signal evaluation uses previous bar values (shift=1) to avoid repainting. SL and TP are applied as absolute price distances calculated from entry price using _Point multiplication.",
